<div class="art-head"><div><div class="up" style="color:#8A8A8A">Beauty · Bad Gastein · Winter</div><h1 class="hd">My Morning Skincare Routine for Dry Skin in Winter</h1><p class="serif stand">My skin felt dry during our winter stay at Badeschloss in Bad Gastein. For my morning skincare, I wanted plenty of nourishment without a greasy finish, and I wanted to avoid unnecessary extra actives. SPF was always part of the routine.</p><div class="hand" style="transform:rotate(-2deg);font-size:34px;margin-top:10px">by Anna, from my own skin</div></div>
<div class="img art-hero"><img src="/img/morn-eyepatch-mirror.webp" alt="Eye patches in the bathroom mirror"></div></div></section>
<section class="p art-grid"><div class="art-body">

<p>I filmed this <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fNF6LL4alPY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">morning routine</a> in our hotel bathroom. Here is what I used that morning, the alternatives I brought along, and a few favourites that make getting ready more enjoyable.</p>
<figure class="fig"><img src="/img/morn-bathroom-window-morning-1200.webp" alt="A woman in a sweatshirt and striped trousers stands at an open bathroom window, with a pendant light, a swing-arm mirror and towels by the basin." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Morning in our hotel bathroom in Bad Gastein.</figcaption></figure>
<h2>At a glance</h2>
<ul>
<li>Face: Pixi Antioxidant Tonic, rhode Peptide Glazing Fluid, melumé Hydrating Cream 8HA.</li>
<li>Eyes: Summer Fridays Jet Lag Eye Patches, worn while I styled my hair.</li>
<li>SPF: Round Lab Camellia Deep Collagen Firming Sun Serum, before makeup.</li>
<li>Small favourites: <a href="https://gisou.com/products/honey-milk-5-in-1-styling-cream" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gisou Honey Milk 5-in-1 Styling Cream</a>, <a href="https://www.melume-skinscience.com/products/glossy-lip-line-eraser" target="_blank" rel="noopener">melumé Glossy Lip Line Eraser Maxi-Lip Filler Balm</a> and Huxley Moroccan Gardener Hand Cream.</li>
</ul>
<h2>Watch the full routine</h2>
<p>The <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fNF6LL4alPY" target="_blank" rel="noopener">morning routine</a> from this article, filmed in our hotel bathroom.</p>
<h2>Winter skincare for dry skin: my face routine</h2>
<p>For my face, I used Pixi Antioxidant Tonic, followed by rhode Peptide Glazing Fluid and melumé Hydrating Cream 8HA.</p>
<p>I had also brought rhode Glazing Milk, melumé Hydrating Serum 8HA and rhode Barrier Restore Cream as alternatives for those same steps. I rotated some products during the trip, and filming gave me a chance to include favourites I hadn’t yet shown in a YouTube routine.</p>
<div class="figrow"><figure class="fig"><img src="/img/morn-skincare-on-bathroom-shelf-1200.webp" alt="Skincare products on a bathroom shelf beside a basin, including a Pixi bottle, rhode and melumé products and Summer Fridays eye patches on a folded towel." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Pixi, rhode, melumé and Summer Fridays on the bathroom shelf.</figcaption></figure><figure class="fig"><img src="/img/morn-applying-skincare-at-mirror-1200.webp" alt="A woman in a grey sweatshirt applies a skincare product with a dropper in front of a round bathroom mirror." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Skincare at the bathroom mirror.</figcaption></figure></div>
<h2>Eye patches while I style my hair</h2>
<p>I put on Summer Fridays Jet Lag Eye Patches and kept them on while I styled my hair. Round Lab Birch Moisturizing Eye Balm was another eye-care option I’d brought, but the patches were what I used that morning.</p>
<p>I applied <a href="https://gisou.com/products/honey-milk-5-in-1-styling-cream" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Gisou Honey Milk 5-in-1 Styling Cream</a> while my hair was still damp, as part of my heat-protection routine. After drying, my hair feels light, loose and hydrated, with less frizz, and the cream doesn’t weigh it down. I always use heat protection when styling, and I’ve been using a Dyson Airwrap for around five years instead of straighteners and curling irons. I’m much happier with the condition of my hair since changing those habits.</p>
<p>I also rotate two shampoos. La’dor Root Re-Boot Activating Shampoo felt more cleansing to me, so I choose it when I want that especially clean feeling. Gisou Honey Gloss Ceramide Therapy Hydrating Shampoo felt more nourishing, and I use it when I want more moisture.</p>
<figure class="fig"><img src="/img/morn-eye-patches-airwrap-1200.webp" alt="A woman with dark blue eye patches under her eyes styles her hair with a Dyson Airwrap in a green-tiled bathroom." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Eye patches on while I style my hair.</figcaption></figure>
<h2>SPF under makeup: my light sun serum</h2>
<p>After styling my hair, I removed the eye patches and applied Round Lab Camellia Deep Collagen Firming Sun Serum.</p>
<p>It’s the SPF I reach for because it feels light and works well under my makeup. I don’t find that it pills, and it leaves no white cast on my skin. It absorbs quickly, leaving a healthy-looking sheen. To me, it feels like another layer of skincare as well as my sunscreen.</p>
<figure class="fig"><img src="/img/morn-applying-spf-1200.webp" alt="A woman applies a line of sunscreen from a pink tube to her cheek in a green-tiled bathroom." loading="lazy"><figcaption>Applying SPF before makeup.</figcaption></figure>
<ProductFacts flip title="Round Lab Sun Serum, at a glance" img="/img/morn-applying-spf-1200.webp" alt="Applying Round Lab Camellia Deep Collagen Firming Sun Serum." pos="50% 40%" rows={[['What it is','Round Lab Camellia Deep Collagen Firming Sun Serum'],['Feels like','Light, absorbs quickly, leaves a healthy-looking sheen'],['Under makeup','Doesn’t pill, no white cast'],['When I use it','Last step of my morning skincare, before makeup']]}/>
<h2>Two small favourites</h2>
<h3>A lip balm that works with just a pencil.</h3>
<p><a href="https://www.melume-skinscience.com/products/glossy-lip-line-eraser" target="_blank" rel="noopener">melumé Glossy Lip Line Eraser Maxi-Lip Filler Balm</a> keeps my lips feeling moisturised for a long time without making them sticky, and I notice a slight plumping effect. I can wear it with just a lip pencil for a finished lip look, even when I’m keeping the rest of my makeup simple.</p>
<h3>Hand cream without the greasy feeling.</h3>
<p>My hands get very dry because of eczema, and a greasy finish often puts me off using hand cream. Huxley Moroccan Gardener Hand Cream feels moisturising on my skin without leaving that oily feeling, and I love its distinctive scent. Huxley is scented, though. If your skin is eczema-prone, it is worth asking a dermatologist, who may recommend fragrance-free creams or ointments.</p>
<blockquote class="quote">Travel usually means taking fewer products.</blockquote>
<h2>Travel skincare: what to pack when space is limited</h2>
<p>If luggage space were unlimited, I’d happily bring all my bottles for the ten-step routines I love. Travel usually means taking fewer products. For a smaller bag, choose the option you enjoy most at each stage rather than treating every pair in the video as two products to bring: This routine is from our December trip to Bad Gastein, and I keep my winter skin routine in my <a href="/skin-guide/barrier-repair/">barrier repair playbook</a>.</p>
<ul>
<li>one toner or tonic;</li>
<li>one fluid or serum;</li>
<li>one cream;</li>
<li>eye patches or an eye balm;</li>
<li>one SPF you like wearing under makeup.</li>
</ul>
